Q: Chart.js not responding to resize in grid column A: <p>in your charts.js offset is usually per data element not a single number for the whole dataset if you want spacing between slices use spacing: 5</p>
<p>youre missing a plaugin registration you should install<br />
<code>npm install charts-plugin-datalebels</code></p>
<p>then in your component</p>
<pre><code>import ChartLabels from 'charts-plugin-datalebels';
import { Chart as ChartJS } from 'chart.js';

ChartJS.register(ChartDataLabels);
</code></pre>
<p>make  a, b, c, exist if they are undefined you will get  errors<br />
make sure you register the required elements</p>
